 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The kingdom is like treasure in the field",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A man found it and hid it again",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In his joy he went and sold his all",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To buy the field where the treasure lay",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sold everything he had",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the pearl of great value",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The merchant found one precious stone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And gave his life for it",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A net let down into the deep sea",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Caught fish of every kind and sort",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They hauled it up upon the shore",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And sat to sort the good from bad",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sold everything he had",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the pearl of great value",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The merchant found one precious stone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And gave his life for it",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At the end of the age they come",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To separate the wicked from the just",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The righteous shine like the sun",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the kingdom of the Father",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sold everything he had",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the pearl of great value",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The merchant found one precious stone",
   "heard": 6,
